63	/// enough, wrap on the next legitimate bracket. Doesn't track `${...}`
64	/// interpolation inside template literals as real nesting; under-counting a
65	/// rare template-literal type's internal depth is an acceptable trade-off for
66	/// a crash-prevention heuristic, never causing a false rejection.
